OL,3,GNEWSAProtest sees 34 held over
OL,4,A'Palestine Action support'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they have arrested 34 people
OL,7,Fat a protest in Leicestershire on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of having "material in
OL,9,Fsupport of" the proscribed group
OL,10,FPalestine Action.
OL,12,FLeicestershire Police said it responded
OL,13,Fto protest activity outside a building
OL,14,Fin Meridian Way, Braunstone, on
OL,15,FThursday morning.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
