OL,3,GNEWSAProtest sees 34 held over
OL,4,A'Palestine Action support'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said 34 people were arrested
OL,7,Funder Section 13 of the Terrorism Act
OL,8,F2000 which makes it an offence "to wear
OL,9,Fclothing or carry articles in public
OL,10,Fwhich arouse reasonable suspicion that
OL,11,Fan individual is a member or supporter
OL,12,Fof Palestine Action".
OL,14,FPolice said officers remained at the
OL,15,Flocation and Counter Terrorism Policing
OL,16,FEast Midlands (CTPEM) was leading the
OL,17,Finvestigation.
